 Git has been modified. The Unregister repository checkbox within the dialog has been moved outside the dialog and changed to a separate\",942\n68,\"--- Record 2921 ---\nComponent: ABAP Environment\nEnvironment: ABAP\nTitle: SAP Logo as favIcon for the SAP Fiori Launchpad\nDescription: The SAP Fiori launchpad browser favIcon will change from the Fiori flower to the SAP logo. The favIcon can be changed in the SAP UI Theme Designer with the theme parameter sapUiShellFavicon.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-05-17\nValid as Of: 2024-05-17\nVersion: ABAP Environment 2405\n\n--- Record 2922 ---\nComponent: ABAP Environment\nEnvironment: ABAP\nTitle: Set the AIR-Key as Custom HTTP Header Field\nDescription: You can now set the AIR key as custom HTTP header for asynchronous SOAP outbound communication with the HTTP header protocol (setting the AIR key for synchronous SOAP outbound communication was already possible).  Once a web service call is performed, the custom HTTP header is reset. If you want to use the same value again, you must set the value again.  See   .\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-04-10\nValid as Of: 2024-05-17\nVersion: ABAP Environment 2405\n\n--- Record 2923 ---\nComponent: ABAP Environment\nEnvironment: ABAP\nTitle: SQL-based Remote Access from SAP HANA Cloud Databases to ABAP Systems\nDescription: The SAP HANA database component of SAP HANA Cloud now supports SQL-based remote access to ABAP core data services (CDS) view entities, which are exposed by an ABAP system (such as SAP BTP, ABAP environment) via ABAP SQL services.  For more information, see Create an ABAP Cloud Remote Source.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-05-06\nValid as Of: 2024-05-17\nVersion: ABAP Environment 2405\n\n--- Record 2924 ---\